•	Specialty blends optimized for specific crops or growing conditions
•	Value-added formulations with biochar or mycorrhizal additives
•	Emerging markets in Asia-Pacific where urban gardening trends are gaining momentum
These developments suggest substantial untapped potential beyond current market penetration levels.
